{"headword":"מַשָּׂא³","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:5\" href=\"/Psalms.38.5\">ψ 38:5</a></sup> <strong>load, burden, lifting, bearing, tribute</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.19\">Ne 13:19</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.17\">2 K 5:17</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשָּׂאוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:5\" href=\"/Exodus.23.5\">Ex 23:5</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשַּׂאֲכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.12\">Dt 1:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשָּׂאָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:27\" href=\"/Numbers.4.27\">Nu 4:27</a> + 2 times;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>load, burden</em> of ass <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:5\" href=\"/Exodus.23.5\">Ex 23:5</a> (E), mules <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.17\">2 K 5:17</a>, camels <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.9\">8:9</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 46:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.46.1\">Is 46:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 46:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.46.2\">2</a>; hanging on a peg <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.25\">Is 22:25</a> (fig.); forbidden on Sabbath <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.21\">Je 17:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.27\">27</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.15\">Ne 13:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.19\">19</a>; fig. of people as burden <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:11\" href=\"/Numbers.11.11\">Nu 11:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:17\" href=\"/Numbers.11.17\">17</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.12\">Dt 1:12</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָיָה לְמ׳ עַל־</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:33\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.33\">2 S 15:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.36\">19:36</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֶל־)</span>, also <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶהְיֶה עָלַי לְמַשָּׂא</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:20\" href=\"/Job.7.20\">Jb 7:20</a>; of iniquities <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:5\" href=\"/Psalms.38.5\">ψ 38:5</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:10\" href=\"/Hosea.8.10\">Ho 8:10</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשֹׁהַ</span>, so 𝔊 We Now GASm."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"n. verb., <em>lifting, uplifting</em>, only <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ נַפְשָׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.25\">Ez 24:25</a> <em>the uplifting of their soul</em>, i.e. that to which they lift up their soul, their heart’s desire."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"n. verb., <em>bearing, carrying</em>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:24\" href=\"/Numbers.4.24\">Nu 4:24</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">לַעֲבֹד</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.25\">2 Ch 20:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.3\">35:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בַּכָּתֵף)</span>, so prob. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.22\">1 Ch 15:22</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.27\">27</a> (cf. Be Kau; > <em>singing, uplifting of voice</em>, e.g. Öt); especially of <em>responsibility and duty of bearing</em> sacred vessels (often ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבֹדָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּקֻדָּה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:15\" href=\"/Numbers.4.15\">Nu 4:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:19\" href=\"/Numbers.4.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:27\" href=\"/Numbers.4.27\">27</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:49\" href=\"/Numbers.4.49\">49</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבֹדַת מ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:47\" href=\"/Numbers.4.47\">47</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁמֶרֶת מ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:31\" href=\"/Numbers.4.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:32\" href=\"/Numbers.4.32\">32</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"perhaps <em>what is carried, brought</em>, i.e. <em>tribute</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּסֶף מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.11\">2 Ch 17:11</a> <em>silver</em> as <em>tribute</em> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְחָה</span>; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָשָׂא\" href=\"/BDB,_נָשָׂא\", dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא</a> <strong>Qal</strong>; others, <em>silver by the load</em>, i.e. in great quantity).—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשָּׂא</span> v. supr. p. 601 b."}],"num":"4."}]},"rid":"BDB06538","strong_numbers":["4853"],"next_hw":"מַשָּׂא⁴","prev_hw":"נָשִׂיא²","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"II.","quotes":[],"GK":["5362"],"TWOT":["1421d","1421e"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}